<h3>Payment</h3><p>The initial payment choices are a minimum ₱2,000, 50% of the final booking total, or 100% of the final booking total. Choose from the valid amounts shown for your booking. Payment proof is reviewed by the Owner. Once the initial payment is verified, further initial-payment proof uploads are closed. Any remaining balance after a verified minimum or 50% payment is due on the event day; a verified full payment has no remaining balance.</p>
<h3>Cancellation</h3><p>After the Owner verifies the initial payment, direct Client cancellation is available for 24 hours. At the exact 24-hour deadline, direct cancellation ends. After that, contact Staff through the booking messaging system to request a review. Staff may approve a cancellation supported by a valid reason. Cancellation does not itself issue a refund.</p>
<h3>Refund review</h3><p>A Client may request refund review only when payment was received but the slot became unavailable because another Client’s payment secured it first, the Client cancels within the 24-hour window, or Staff approves a Client cancellation after review. The Owner reviews refund requests and confirms any actual refund. A request or cancellation does not promise or automatically issue a refund.</p>
<h3>Rescheduling</h3><p>Rescheduling remains subject to availability and the existing Staff review process.</p>
<h3>Service guarantee</h3><p>The service provider shall render the agreed service on the confirmed event date and time.</p>
<h3>Feedback and media</h3><p>Feedback is private unless you explicitly choose public sharing. Public feedback and selected media remain subject to Staff moderation and approval. You may withdraw public-sharing consent through your feedback details.</p>
<h3>Schedule priority & confirmation</h3><p>Submitting this request does not reserve the schedule. Valid payment-proof submission determines schedule priority under the existing payment policy. Uploading proof does not verify payment; Owner verification is required before confirmation.</p>
